{"id":"memorial_100201","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial100200","label":"Memoirs · Survival Guide 01"},"label":"1. How To Avoid Raptures","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"memorial_100202","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_100201_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_02_01_description","text":"Don't make any loud noises."},{"id":"memorial_100201_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_02_01_description","text":"When conversing with others, keep your voice as low as possible."},{"id":"memorial_100201_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_02_01_description","text":"Watch your footsteps and tread lightly."},{"id":"memorial_100201_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_02_01_description","text":"Shooting is a guaranteed way of exposing yourself."},{"id":"memorial_100201_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_02_01_description","text":"In other words, it's better to ignore armed marauders."},{"id":"memorial_100201_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_02_01_description","text":"If you fire your gun, the first bullet that is ejected will seal your fate."}]}